{"title":"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Karl's rectangular vegetable garden is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet, and Makenna's is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet. Whose garden is larger in area?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/9663f3d7d10547bcfddb73e33bc7ffcf56339904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{Karl&#39;s garden is larger by 100 square feet.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"338\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0eba0d7b6ab37d3c4f18e059fb5b8155f1e1eb0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{Karl&#39;s garden is larger by 25 square feet.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"329\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46bc277b545f487be7156e2b7acf525dfcd076d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{The gardens are the same size.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"256\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59c9bd5b1da2dc19b3e7ad79551d868d8a972811.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{Makenna&#39;s garden is larger by 25 square feet.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"363\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f838c9e32df01f5a7de9f397b89fcf2d548287c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{Makenna&#39;s garden is larger by 100 square feet.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"369\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of a rectangle is given by the formula length times width. Karl's garden is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/2067a5f51515492704b9d0c4d37ae879d206cf0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\times 45 = 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" /> square feet and Makenna's garden is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1093a0d46888ded5d1313a37bc0f055835fa36a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 \\times 40 = 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" /> square feet. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/a/41a3062c26667f79029178e7b7328691685572c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000 &gt; 900,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> Makenna's garden is larger by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b35d0d065b6d8f24d5a87beb78a6b1bc764e317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000-900=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"136\" height=\"13\" /> square feet. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/09656bb9e7b21dcf58320a17986da5bcf1caa54b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow \\boxed{ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{Makenna&#39;s garden is larger by 100 square feet.} }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"405\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CzAPGrFs0xs\">https://youtu.be/CzAPGrFs0xs</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 8\">2011 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2011\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems